      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<section class=\"pricing-template\" aria-labelledby=\"pricing-title\">\n  <header><h2 id=\"pricing-title\">选择适合你的方案</h2><p>透明定价，随时升级或取消。</p></header>\n  <div class=\"pricing-template__plans\">\n    <article><h3>基础版</h3><p class=\"pricing-template__price\"><span>¥29</span> / 月</p><p>适合个人项目与轻量使用。</p><ul><li>10 GB 存储</li><li>社区支持</li><li>基础分析</li></ul><a href=\"#basic\">选择基础版</a></article>\n    <article class=\"pricing-template__featured\" aria-label=\"专业版，推荐方案\"><span class=\"pricing-template__badge\">推荐</span><h3>专业版</h3><p class=\"pricing-template__price\"><span>¥99</span> / 月</p><p>适合需要协作和洞察的小团队。</p><ul><li>100 GB 存储</li><li>优先支持</li><li>高级分析</li></ul><a href=\"#pro\">选择专业版</a></article>\n    <article><h3>企业版</h3><p class=\"pricing-template__price\"><span>定制</span></p><p>适合需要安全与服务保障的组织。</p><ul><li>弹性存储</li><li>专属顾问</li><li>服务等级协议</li></ul><a href=\"#enterprise\">联系销售</a></article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.pricing-template { box-sizing: border-box; padding: 72px 24px; color: #0f172a; background: #f8fafc; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }\n.pricing-template > header { margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center; }\n.pricing-template > header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }\n.pricing-template > header p { margin: 12px 0 0; color: #64748b; }\n.pricing-template__plans { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 22px; max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.pricing-template article { position: relative; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid #dbe3ef; border-radius: 20px; background: #ffffff; }\n.pricing-template__featured { border: 2px solid #4f46e5 !important; box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(79, 70, 229, .12); }\n.pricing-template__badge { position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 16px; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; color: #ffffff; background: #4f46e5; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; }\n.pricing-template h3 { margin: 0; }\n.pricing-template__price { margin: 20px 0 8px; color: #64748b; }\n.pricing-template__price span { color: #312e81; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; }\n.pricing-template article > p:not(.pricing-template__price) { min-height: 48px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.5; }\n.pricing-template ul { min-height: 126px; padding-left: 20px; color: #334155; line-height: 2; }\n.pricing-template article > a { display: block; min-height: 44px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #4f46e5; border-radius: 10px; color: #4338ca; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; }\n.pricing-template a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #818cf8; outline-offset: 3px; }\n</style>\n"
    }
